# Lost Chick (hidden quest LostChick), San d'Oria: a level 30 Warrior in Southern San d'Oria. The search state is the
# char var [ChocoboRaising]LostChick (owner 0-3, clues 4-5, location 6-7, result 16-17, solved 18), which the chocobo
# raising walks write (a GM's charvar here). No chick: the owners' and Hantileon's own scripts / defaults answer. Owner
# 1 (Coderiant), 3 clues, San d'Oria (113): Violitte (no ask) plays 851 (1); an update on 5 (not her guess 2): the map
# vendor's xi.maps.onEventUpdate(595, ...) (no map bought: option & 0xF ~= 1; nothing sent back). Coderiant (an ask
# owner: no trigger of the quest; his default 583): the guess (2) before the ask: nothing; the ask (1): the local Asked
# 1, updateEvent(1, 1, 1). Again: ask, then guess: Asked 0, right: updateEvent(1, 1, 1), the Story of a Diligent
# Chocobo (addKeyItem, then KEYITEM_OBTAINED), the var RETURNED and solved (0x50000); a second guess: the check fails
# (owner 0): nothing. Hantileon: 852 ([0] = 0, [1] = 1, [7] = 1); the finish: the result cleared (0x40000). Hantileon
# again: the check fails: his script. CHECK in the first trace: Coderiant's default is 583 (the lost_chick.lua test
# says so).
lists SouthernSanDoria/Violitte/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Coderiant/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Hantileon/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventUpdate/851 SouthernSanDoria/onEventUpdate/583 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/852
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-1,0,-105 job=WAR lvl=30 gil=1000
login
trigger Violitte                        # no chick: the check fails: her script (the map shop)
finish-if-event
charvar [ChocoboRaising]LostChick 113   # owner 1 (Coderiant), 3 clues, San d'Oria
trigger Violitte                        # 851 (1)
update 851 option=5                     # not her guess: xi.maps.onEventUpdate(595, 5): no purchase
finish
trigger Coderiant                       # his default 583 (no quest trigger: an ask owner)
update 583 option=2                     # the guess before the ask: nothing
update 583 option=1                     # the ask: Asked 1, updateEvent(1, 1, 1)
finish
trigger Coderiant                       # 583
update 583 option=1                     # the ask: updateEvent(1, 1, 1)
update 583 option=2                     # right: updateEvent(1, 1, 1); the story; RETURNED, solved; KEYITEM_OBTAINED
update 583 option=2                     # owner 0: the check fails: nothing
finish
trigger Hantileon                       # 852 ([0] = 0, [1] = 1, [7] = 1)
finish                                  # the result cleared (solved kept)
trigger Hantileon                       # result NONE: the check fails: his script
finish-if-event
